18:["$","section",null,{"id":"why-migrate","data-reveal":true,"className":"scroll-mt-24 border-b-hairline-soft py-20","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label)]","children":"Why migrate"}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"mt-4 max-w-[26ch] font-display text-display-l font-extrabold text-fg [text-wrap:balance]","children":"Obsolete servers don't just slow you down — they cost you."}],["$","div",null,{"className":"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"rounded-2xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-8","children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)]","children":"Staying on obsolete servers"}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"mt-6 space-y-4","children":[["$","li","Security exposure — unpatched OS and hardware are an open door; one breach can sink a business.,Security exposure",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"mt-[0.55em] h-px w-3 shrink-0 bg-fg-muted"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-fg","children":"Security exposure"}]," — unpatched OS and hardware are an open door; one breach can sink a business."]}]]}],["$","li","Unplanned downtime — aging machines fail, and every hour offline costs revenue and trust.,Unplanned downtime",{"className":"flex gap-3","children":[["$","span",null,{"aria-hidden":true,"className":"mt-[0.55em] h-px w-3 shrink-0 bg-fg-muted"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-bold text-fg","children":"Unplanned downtime"}]," — aging machines fail, and every hour offline costs revenue and trust."]}]]}],["$","li","Can't scale — fixed capacity means you over-buy for peaks and still fall over on the big day.,Can't scale",{"classN