e":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"Sized to the magnitude of the move — scoped and priced up front, billed against delivered milestones."}]]}],["$","li","Hourly engineering",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)]","children":"Per hour · from $50 USD"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Hourly engineering"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"Senior cloud and DevOps time when you need it — ad-hoc fixes, optimizations, or a focused sprint."}]]}],["$","li","Managed cloud",{"className":"flex flex-col rounded-xl border-hairline bg-white/[0.015] p-6","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono text-label-s uppercase text-fg-muted [letter-spacing:var(--tracking-label-tight)]","children":"Monthly retainer"}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"mt-3 font-display text-display-s font-bold text-fg","children":"Managed cloud"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-2 font-mono text-body-sm text-fg-secondary","children":"Ongoing maintenance, monitoring, and FinOps as a fixed monthly rate — predictable and scoped to your platform."}]]}]]}]]}]
