":"{name} — case studies","pillarHeroEyebrow":"Industry · Case Studies","pillarHeroTitle":"{name} Case Studies","pillarStatInCategory":"{count, plural, one {Case in {name}} other {Cases in {name}}}","pillarStatAllIndustries":"Across all industries","pillarStatClientTypes":"Client types served","pillarPerspectiveEyebrow":"Industry perspective","pillarPerspectiveTitle":"Where {name} is going.","pillarPerspectiveBody":"The pattern we keep seeing across this sector: technology rarely creates new problems — it amplifies the operational ones that were already there. The clients who win are the ones who let tooling expose the gaps, then close them deliberately rather than reactively.","pillarWhoServed":"Who we've served","pillarCasesInCategory":"Cases in {name}","pillarEmptyTitle":"No published cases in this industry — yet.","pillarEmptyBody":"We've done work in this sector; the case studies just haven't been published. While we prepare them, browse <link>all cases</link> or talk to us directly.","pillarRelatedEyebrow":"Related expertise","pillarRelatedTitle":"Other industries we've worked in","pillarCtaTitle":"Ready to transform your {name} operation?","pillarCtaBody":"We've seen the patterns. We know what works in this sector. Tell us what you're trying to fix and we'll tell you whether we're the right team for it — honestly.","pillarCtaButton":"Let's talk","detailMetaTitle":"{title} — {name} Case Study","detailMetaTitleShort":"{title} — Case Study","minRead":"{minutes} min read","tocHeading":"In this study","tocAria":"Case study table of contents","tocClient":"The Client","tocDiagnosis":"Diagnosis","tocApproach":"Our Approach","tocTech":"Tech Stack","tocResults":"Results","tocTestimonial":"Testimonial","tocTakeaways":"Key Takeaways","tocFaq":"FAQ","servicesAdEyebrow":"What we do","servicesAdAria":"Featured services","servicesAdAll":"All services","behindProject":"Behind the project","servicesDeliveredEyebrow":"Services delivered","servicesDeliveredTitle":"The practice a